{"3640200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dawson Oaks Trailer Park", "steam_appid": 3640200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4953160], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUSPECTS </strong>(11 Unique Roles) <br><br>Do your crimes. Work together. Don't be too obvious</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit your role-specific urges to stay sane, but don’t make it obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you wait, the more unstable you become… and the easier it is for others to expose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspect roles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug Dealer, Junkie, Moonshine Cook, Creep, Scrapper, Pyromaniac, Gambler, Thief, Drunk, Prankster, Hobo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.poster.avif?t=1788170977\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.webm?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.mp4?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPERVISOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch everyone. Figure out who’s doing what, and call the police before it’s too late. Call the police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget. You only have power if you have information...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.poster.avif?t=1788170977\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.webm?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.mp4?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNITCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in as a suspect, track everyone’s behavior, and secretly report everything to the Supervisor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know more than anyone else.<br>But if they figure out who you are, you’re done.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.poster.avif?t=1788170977\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.webm?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.mp4?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEETINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any moment, the suspects can call a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone gathers, pretends to be friendly…<br>and votes on who they think the Snitch is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get it wrong, and the real Snitch stays hidden.<br>Get it right, and the suspects take control.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUSPECTS </strong>(11 Unique Roles) <br><br>Do your crimes. Work together. Don't be too obvious</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit your role-specific urges to stay sane, but don’t make it obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you wait, the more unstable you become… and the easier it is for others to expose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspect roles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug Dealer, Junkie, Moonshine Cook, Creep, Scrapper, Pyromaniac, Gambler, Thief, Drunk, Prankster, Hobo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.poster.avif?t=1788170977\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.webm?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/31c01974518626ed78cc25b7b868fc04.mp4?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPERVISOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch everyone. Figure out who’s doing what, and call the police before it’s too late. Call the police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget. You only have power if you have information...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.poster.avif?t=1788170977\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.webm?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/2492e3324a7b5ee0d6c07574baab00f3.mp4?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNITCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in as a suspect, track everyone’s behavior, and secretly report everything to the Supervisor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know more than anyone else.<br>But if they figure out who you are, you’re done.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.poster.avif?t=1788170977\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.webm?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/extras/3d5ae9db200d24f9c11c5febacffa727.mp4?t=1788170977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEETINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any moment, the suspects can call a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone gathers, pretends to be friendly…<br>and votes on who they think the Snitch is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get it wrong, and the real Snitch stays hidden.<br>Get it right, and the suspects take control.</p>", "short_description": "A proximity voice chat social deduction game where criminals must commit secret crimes while a Supervisor hunts them, and a hidden Snitch betrays them from within.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Polish, Swedish, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/cfc3aa438d35284aea9e5081add3d968061e9653/header.jpg?t=1788170977", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640200/230fbbc595e851c9d2c67a6a936637c550346e65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788170977", "capsule_imagev5": "https://sha